   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Order of pronouns",
     "texto": [
      "In these combinations, **me / te / nous / vous** goes before **le / la / les**: **Tu me le prêtes ?** (will you lend it to me?).",
      "With **lui / leur**, the order is **le / la / les + lui / leur**: **Je le lui donne** (I give it to him)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Other combined pronouns",
     "texto": [
      "**Y** and **en** can also be combined: **Je t'y attends** (I'm waiting for you there), **Je lui en parle** (I talk to him about it).",
      "In the affirmative imperative, the pronouns go after the verb and are joined with hyphens: **Donne-le-moi** (give it to me)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
